{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>運輸署於今日（17日）上午06時16分宣佈，接獲港鐵公司通知，由於羅湖站附近信號設備故障，東鐵綫的列車服務受到影響。</p><p>稍後，至6時47分事故已處理，服務逐步恢復正常。</p><figure><img alt=\"羅湖站。（Google Maps）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/cis/5e30f2ac8baaf82bda1d8ddf.jpg/ccWuV7FVhlhJfvVUFcKFe9NWrwpxDCkyYdv21GHb9tQ\"/><figcaption>羅湖站。（Google Maps）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-17T00:38:05.465151+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":101,"images":1,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}